flowchart TD
    publish{"Do you publish your site<br/>with agent-ks 0.x?"}
    stay["Read 'Staying on agent-ks 0.x'<br/>before you go on"]
    install["Install agentks<br/>once per machine"]
    commit["In each project:<br/>commit everything"]
    dry["agentks migrate --dry-run"]
    migrate["agentks migrate"]
    fix["Do what the report<br/>leaves for you"]
    check["agentks check …<br/>agentks start"]
    clean["Remove the old framework folder<br/>and swap the plugin"]

    publish -->|yes| stay
    stay -.->|"when you are ready"| install
    publish -->|no| install
    install --> commit --> dry --> migrate --> fix --> check --> clean
